ekce",{"ran":49,"cached":50,"skipped":51},"spustil se","už načteno","neodpovídá",{"title":53,"lead":54,"key":55,"note":56},"Záložní jazyk","Klíč, který aktivní jazyk nemá, se vyhodnotí přes fallbackLocale, místo aby zůstal prázdný.","Klíč","Zálohují se jen chybějící klíče. Co vykreslí klíč chybějící všude, určuje fallbackValue.",{"site.tagline":58,"nav.home":59,"nav.docs":60,"nav.playground":61,"nav.github":7,"nav.language":62,"lang.en":9,"lang.cs":10,"lang.de":11,"banner.v3":63,"error.title":64,"error.404":65,"error.default":66,"error.home":67,"playground":68},"Internationalization for SvelteKit","Home","Documentation","Playground","Language","This is the documentation for v3. For the v2 line, see the {{branch}} branch.","Something went wrong","This page does not exist.","An unexpected error occurred.","Back to the homepage",{"title":61,"lead":69,"source":70,"output":71,"parser":72,"preprocess":81,"loaders":86,"fallback":100},"Every panel below drives a real instance through the public API. Change an input and the library answers — nothing here is a recording.","Show the code","Output",{"title":73,"lead":74,"format":75,"flavour":76,"message":77,"payload":78,"locale":79,"silent":80},"Message formats","The core holds no message format of its own: a parser fills the slot. Curly comes with this package; ICU is the alternative, on the core directly.","Message format",{"curly":26,"icu":27},"Message","Payload","Locale","No reports. A report never raises — the placeholder takes its fallback and the rest of the message resolves.",{"title":82,"lead":83,"input":84,"note":85},"Preprocessing","Nested translations become the flat keys t() reads. The mode decides how far that goes.","Translations","rawTranslations keeps the input as it arrived; translations is what you see here.",{"title":87,"lead":88,"locale":79,"route":39,"load":89,"invalidate":90,"reset":42,"empty":91,"shape":92,"status":96},"Loaders","A loader runs when its locale matches and its routes match the current rout